Package: lsd-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Linux Simple Diagnostic <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Recommends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Linux Simple Diagnostic agent (host metrics and eBPF network flows)
 Collects CPU, memory, disk and network metrics and, with eBPF, host-to-host
 traffic volumes, and sends them to a Linux Simple Diagnostic server over gRPC.
 Installed in /opt/lsd/agent and run as a systemd service. Needs
 Linux 5.8 or newer for the capabilities it uses (CAP_BPF, CAP_PERFMON).
